4
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:11,340
Brother Mouchuan, it’s so soft down there.

5
00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:12,340
That's it

6
00:00:12,340 --> 00:00:15,340
This mud can be kneaded into balls, but how do you burn it?

7
00:00:15,340 --> 00:00:18,900
Isn’t this Brother Mouchuan?

8
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:20,900
It's such a cold day, why are you two running here?

9
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:21,900
Dredging

10
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:22,900
Dredging

11
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:24,900
What are you doing digging in the mud in this world of ice and snow?

12
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:27,900
Is it possible that I still want to wear it here? I am even confused about human nature and whatnot.

13
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:29,900
